      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a ghost. like, everything i actually was... my work, my friends, the way people looked at me... it's all just gone. it's like i was deleted from the world and there's nothing left but this shell. i dont even recognize the person in the mirror anymore. it doesnt feel like i'm actually here.",
