    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think there's an \"inner self\" to find. that's just something people say to feel better. when the social connection is cut, the connection to reality goes with it. i look at my life and i just see a glitch. a mistake that kept happening after the actual program was shut down. it feels so much more logical to just... stop. like, wouldn't it be more peaceful to just let the rest of me go too?",
